Meta.documentation:String.split
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Splits Strings into pieces at given positions.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Every Number in the flow (or given as a parameter) is a cut
Meta.documentation:position: absolute index, clamped to the string, duplicates
Meta.documentation:removed, applied in ascending order. Each subject String is
Meta.documentation:emitted piece by piece, left to right.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@port in_String_default_$all — each String to split
Meta.documentation:@port in_Number_position — a cut position (parameter drop-in)
Meta.documentation:@port in_Number_default_$all — each further cut position
Meta.documentation:@port out_String_default — the pieces, in order
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@example
Meta.documentation:[String:abcdef Number:2 Number:4]>>String.split:>>Console:
Meta.documentation:---
Meta.documentation:ab
Meta.documentation:cd
Meta.documentation:ef
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@example
Meta.documentation:String:hello>>String.split:?|position=2>>Console:
Meta.documentation:---
Meta.documentation:he
Meta.documentation:llo
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@see String.substring String.replace
Meta.documentation:@kind operator
Meta.documentation:@status stable

[Native.Javascript:const%20Resource%20%20%3D%20Dawn.require(%22Content-Type%2Fdata%2FResource%22)%3B%0A%0A%2F%2F%20Splits%20Strings%20at%20given%20positions%3A%20%5BString%3Aabcdef%20Number%3A2%20Number%3A4%5D%3E%3EString.split%3A%0A%2F%2F%20emits%20%22ab%22%2C%20%22cd%22%2C%20%22ef%22.%20Positions%20are%20absolute%20indices%20(cut%20points)%2C%0A%2F%2F%20clamped%20to%20the%20string%2C%20deduplicated%20and%20applied%20in%20ascending%20order.%0Afunction%20split()%0A%7B%0A%09Resource.call(this%2C%22split%22)%3B%0A%09this.Processor%3DsplitProcessor%3B%0A%09return%20this%3B%0A%7D%0A%0Afunction%20splitProcessor(resource)%0A%7B%0A%09Resource.Processor.call(this%2Cresource)%3B%20%0A%09this.resource%20%3D%20resource%3B%0A%09this.out_String_default%20%3D%20null%3B%0A%09this.in_begin%20%3D%20function()%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09this.subjects%20%3D%20%5B%5D%3B%0A%09%09this.positions%20%3D%20%5B%5D%3B%0A%09%09return%20this.fire_end_parameters()%3B%20%2F%2F%20pre-positioned%20parameter%20inputs%0A%20%20%20%20%7D%0A%20%20%20%20function%20addPosition(input)%0A%20%20%20%20%7B%0A%09%09this.positions.push(Math.floor(input.value.valueOf()))%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%7D%0A%09this.in_Number_position%20%3D%20addPosition%3B%0A%09this.in_Number_default_%24all%20%3D%20addPosition%3B%0A%09this.in_String_default_%24all%20%3D%20function(input)%0A%20%20%20%20%7B%0A%09%09this.subjects.push(input.value)%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%7D%0A%09this.in_end%20%3D%20function()%0A%20%20%20%20%7B%0A%09%09let%20positions%20%3D%20%5B...new%20Set(this.positions)%5D.sort((a%2Cb)%3D%3Ea-b)%3B%0A%09%09for%20(let%20i%20in%20this.subjects)%0A%09%09%7B%0A%09%09%09let%20s%20%3D%20this.subjects%5Bi%5D%3B%0A%09%09%09let%20cuts%20%3D%20positions.filter(p%20%3D%3E%20p%3E0%20%26%26%20p%3Cs.length)%3B%0A%09%09%09let%20prev%20%3D%200%3B%0A%09%09%09for%20(let%20j%20in%20cuts)%0A%09%09%09%7B%0A%09%09%09%09this%3F.out_String_default%3F.(%7Bvalue%3As.substring(prev%2C%20cuts%5Bj%5D)%7D)%3B%0A%09%09%09%09prev%20%3D%20cuts%5Bj%5D%3B%0A%09%09%09%7D%0A%09%09%09this%3F.out_String_default%3F.(%7Bvalue%3As.substring(prev)%7D)%3B%0A%09%09%7D%0A%20%20%20%20%7D%0A%7D%0Asplit.Processor%3DsplitProcessor%3B%0Amodule.exports%3Dsplit%3B]>>NewResource:String.split
